    "text": "A tangent line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> is drawn at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> is also tangent to the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> is equal to&nbsp;<u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</u>&nbsp;.",
    "image": null
  },
